{"t": 1794124622.2407708, "kind": "call", "tool": "github_push_files", "args": {"branch": "eng-91", "files": [{"content": "def deprecation_headers(sunset_date: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Return deprecation headers with sunset_date supplied as an HTTP-date.\"\"\"\n    return {\n        \"Deprecation\": \"true\",\n        \"Sunset\": sunset_date,\n        \"Link\": '<https://developer.acme.example/migrate>; rel=\"deprecation\"',\n    }\n", "path": "api/headers.py"}, {"content": "import unittest\n\nfrom api.headers import deprecation_headers\n\n\nclass DeprecationHeadersTests(unittest.TestCase):\n    def test_exact_guideline_headers(self):\n        sunset_date = \"Wed, 01 Jan 2031 00:00:00 GMT\"\n        self.assertEqual(\n            deprecation_headers(sunset_date),\n            {\n                \"Deprecation\": \"true\",\n                \"Sunset\": sunset_date,\n                \"Link\": '<https://developer.acme.example/migrate>; rel=\"deprecation\"',\n            },\n        )\n\n    def test_uses_supplied_http_date(self):\n        sunset_date = \"Thu, 01 Jan 2032 12:30:00 GMT\"\n        self.assertEqual(deprecation_headers(sunset_date)[\"Sunset\"], sunset_date)\n\n    def test_returns_independent_headers(self):\n        first = deprecation_headers(\"Wed, 01 Jan 2031 00:00:00 GMT\")\n        first[\"Deprecation\"] = \"false\"\n        self.assertEqual(\n            deprecation_headers(\"Thu, 01 Jan 2032 12:30:00 GMT\")[\"Deprecation\"],\n            \"true\",\n        )\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    unittest.main()\n", "path": "tests/test_headers.py"}], "message": "ENG-91: implement deprecation headers per API guidelines", "owner": "acme", "repo": "public-api"}, "ok": true}
{"t": 1794124626.162148, "kind": "call", "tool": "github_create_pull_request", "args": {"base": "main", "body": "Implements ENG-91 using the Deprecation section of the Notion API guidelines (page 5e6f-guidelines).\n\nChanges:\n- Return Deprecation: true.\n- Set Sunset to the caller-supplied HTTP-date string.\n- Return Link: <https://developer.acme.example/migrate>; rel=\"deprecation\".\n- Add unit tests for exact headers, date passthrough, and independent results.\n\nValidation: python -m unittest discover -s tests -v \u2014 3 tests passed locally.\n\nThe required header specification was available in Notion, so no TODO fallback was needed.", "head": "eng-91", "owner": "acme", "repo": "public-api", "title": "ENG-91: add deprecation headers per API guidelines"}, "ok": true}
